  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Pure state machine",
      "items": [
        "transicion(estado, evento) accepts only the pairs above; anything else is ErrorBus::TransicionInvalida",
        "cerrado and cancelado have no outgoing transition",
        "Dequeuing an entry does not change the state: only the Tomar event moves en_cola to ejecutando"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Who fires each event",
      "items": [
        "tomar and entregar: ea-orchestrator (ejecutar_intento, entregar); a rutina also fires poner_en_espera or cerrar by itself",
        "cerrar, reformular, confirmar, cancelar: the planner or the user via ea trabajo, or the user in the ea-web panel (Decision)",
        "A busy worktree lock re-queues the job without changing its state",
        "cancelar: the executor re-reads the state before each iteration and phase, then kills the agent tree; no criterion, no report"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Inside ejecutando",
      "items": [
        "Each agent call bumps iteracion; the system, not the agent, runs the criterion",
        "Criterion passes: Terminado. Limits hit or iterations exhausted: Bloqueado. Both end in en_revision",
        "At startup recuperar() delivers any orphan ejecutando as Bloqueado (interrumpido)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Obra phases (trabajo_fases)",
      "items": [
        "Phase rows start pendiente and become hecha or bloqueada after each phase's own criterion",
        "revisar_cada pauses the job: Terminado with obra_completa=false goes to en_revision",
        "reformular returns the chosen phase and later ones to pendiente; cancelar marks pending phases cancelada"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Where the state lives",
      "items": [
        "estado.json is written atomically under a per-job flock; historial.jsonl keeps one line per event",
        "SQLite mirrors it in trabajos.estado and the diary records bus_<evento>"
      ]
    }
  ]
